  "notes": [
    "Place visual treatment reads semantic places and adds non-blocking scene accents.",
    "Rules are deterministic and never change terrain, movement, collision, routes or markers.",
    "Version 2 adds content catalog metadata for future varied micro scene placement.",
    "Object roles are metadata only; no gameplay interaction is implemented here."
  ],
